	(text "VOUT = 1.233 V x (1 + 499k / 52.3k) = 13.00 V (0.5 % / 0.1 % divider); CFF C40 33 pF across R26 (tune 22-100 pF).                                     \nEN tied to OLED_VIN: the input disconnect does the switching.  L 10 uH, Isat 0.72 A rated (0.92 A typ; peak need 0.49 A).\nLAYOUT: tight CIN-L-SW-GND and SW-D-COUT-GND loops; R26/R27/C40 at the FB pin, away from SW."
